{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2021-12-14 13:00:00', 'title': 'LAS VEGAS SANDS NAMED TO THE 2021 CDP WATER A AND CLIMATE A LISTS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, DEC. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LAS VEGAS SANDS (NYSE: LVS) HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY GLOBAL ENVIRONMENTAL NONPROFIT CDP ON ITS 2021 CLIMATE AND WATER A LISTS, MARKING CONSECUTIVE APPEARANCE ON THE CLIMATE A LIST FOR THE SEVENTH YEAR AND THE WATER A LIST FOR THE FOURTH YEAR. INCLUSION ON CDP\'S CLIMATE A AND WATER A LISTS PUTS SANDS AMONG 55 COMPANIES WHO RECEIVED AN "A" DESIGNATION ON BOTH LISTS, OUT OF THE 12,000 COMPANIES THAT WERE SCORED IN 2021.'}